-PASS a.href is 'foo:^^'
-Set a protocol that starts with ':'
-PASS a.href is 'https://www.mydomain.com/path/'
-Set protocol to null
-PASS a.href is 'null://www.mydomain.com/path/'
-Set protocol to empty string
-PASS a.href is 'https://www.mydomain.com/path/'
